#: ../doc/files.rst:129
msgid "Use Fit Window to size the video area to the source aspect ratio. Black bars already encoded in the source remain visible."
msgstr ""

#: ../doc/files.rst:131
msgid "Seeking during playback keeps playback running. Dragging to resize, move, or draw a range pauses playback so its boundary frames can be inspected."
msgstr ""

